// AWS EC2 Serial Console Access  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1021.007
// Detects EC2 serial console access (SendSerialConsoleSSHPublicKey/StartSerialConsoleSession), which provides low-level instance access that…
// False positives: Break-glass instance troubleshooting (serial console is often disabled by default).
// Source: rules/lateral-movement/ec2-serial-console-ssh-key.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^SendSerialConsoleSSHPublicKey$/i or eventName=/^StartSerialConsoleSession$/i
